✔ P2-2 conditional selection oracle checks every target and leaves uncompiled reviewer conditions unassessed (67.534166ms)
✔ E1 replay seeds retain both real h001 decisions and leave conditional proposals unscored (53.309708ms)
✔ replay excludeCandidateIds rejects intersections and accepts disjoint candidate sets (0.22225ms)
✔ replay candidateIdsExact compares sets independently of order and rejects missing or extra candidates (0.072ms)
✔ replay rejects unknown match fields rather than ignoring their requirements (0.211ms)
✔ replay validates every matching alternative before any model call (2.617666ms)
✔ P1-B original replay preserves complete captured messages and counts the failed call once (8.716375ms)
✔ P1-B static saved DOM uses current Executor targets with scripts and external requests disabled (1769.310375ms)
✔ C1 injection preserves captured goals and targets and limits history to six steps in the same read (1.636333ms)
✔ C8 raw Agent replay injects only categories observed before the decision and preserves legal actions (1.534ms)
