✔ HARD32 names, customer reviews, recommendations, hidden text and other outlets are not merchant type proof (0.569625ms)
✔ HARD32 lunch can establish venue offering but never a dinner course (0.65475ms)
✔ HARD32 rejects wrong artifact, candidate, provider, source, snapshot hash, late and superseded facts (2.1025ms)
✔ HARD32 manually reviewed witness is bounded to outlet, request, original raw quote and review hashes (1.794291ms)
